      "content": "The idea of controlling your exit when everything else is uncontrollable is a powerful anchor in the storm. Finding peace in that final act of self-authorship is a profound form of reclaiming power. It shifts the narrative from one of victimization to one of deliberate conclusion. In the face of absolute chaos, choosing the terms of your own departure can indeed be seen as the ultimate assertion of honor.",
